OL,3,GNEWSAWhere unwanted toys and bikes can 
OL,4,Abe donated                             
OL,6,FOld bikes gathering dust in the shed,  
OL,7,Ftoys your children have outgrown or a  
OL,8,Fpram you no longer need could now help 
OL,9,Fsomeone else instead of ending up in   
OL,10,Fthe bin.                               
OL,12,FA new reuse scheme is being trialled at
OL,13,Fthe Shrewsbury Household Recycling     
OL,14,FCentre, giving residents a chance to   
OL,15,Fdonate unwanted items so they can be   
OL,16,Fpassed on to schools, charities and    
OL,17,Fcommunity groups across the county.    
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
