OL,3,GNEWSAWhere unwanted toys and bikes can 
OL,4,Abe donated                             
OL,6,FRun by Shropshire Council and recycling
OL,7,Fcompany Veolia, the scheme aims to keep
OL,8,Fgood-quality items in use for longer   
OL,9,Fand get them into the hands of local   
OL,10,Forganisations that can put them to good
OL,11,Fuse.                                   
OL,13,FWhile recycling turns old materials    
OL,14,Finto new products, the idea behind the 
OL,15,Fscheme is simple: If something is still
OL,16,Fuseful, why throw it away?             
